<title>UK: CFD sets 1.6 bln French franc 12-year bond, +5 bp.</title>
<headline>CFD sets 1.6 bln French franc 12-year bond, +5 bp.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following domestic bond was announced by joint lead managers Credit Lyonnais and Deutsche Morgan Grenfell.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CREDIT FRANCAISE DE DEVELOPPMENT</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  FRANCE (RATED AAA/AAA)</p>
<p> AMT    1.6 BLN FFR   COUPON     6.00	MATURITY    18.DEC.08</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.15    PAY DATE    18.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.30	REOFFER    100.20    SPREAD	+5 BP</p>
<p> LISTING    PARIS     DENOMS (K) FIVE	SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND OAT CURVE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
